<title>POLAND: Polish c.bank sells PLN 255 mln 91-day bills.</title>
<headline>Polish c.bank sells PLN 255 mln 91-day bills.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold 255 million zlotys of 91-day NBP-bills after Polish banks bid for the same amount, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The average yield at for the 91-day paper increased to 22.19 percent from 22.13 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
